    {
      "id": "A1-17-L2",
      "position": 2,
      "skill": "grammar",
      "title": "قاعدة: There is / There are + in, on, under",
      "est_minutes": 15,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "audio",
          "text_en": "There is a pot on the stove. There are two cups on the table. There is water in the fridge. There is a bag under the table."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "markdown_ar": "لنقول «يوجد» نستخدم:\n\n- **There is** + شيء **واحد**: There **is** a pot on the stove. (يوجد قدر على الموقد)\n- **There are** + **أكثر من واحد**: There **are** two cups on the table. (يوجد كوبان)\n\nولنقول **أين** الشيء نستخدم حروف الجر:\n- **in** (داخل): in the fridge\n- **on** (فوق ولامس): on the stove\n- **under** (تحت): under the table\n\n**الخطأ الشائع:** «There is two cups». الصحيح: **There are** two cups."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
